<Base lang="en" title="About"><article class="prose"><p class="label">About</p><h1>Schlaflied, a room by Syna.</h1><p>A public space where writing, learning, AI, open source, and traces of a life share the same desk. None of these need to justify the others, and none is reduced to a professional label.</p><p>The site lives in Chinese and English side by side. The languages will not always map one-to-one: originals, translations, introductions, and project notes will arrive in the language that suits them.</p></article></Base>
